%% Mission Control Runtime V2 - the engine every request runs on (canonical, queue #21).
%% One request, from the surface it arrived on to the receipt it leaves behind.
%% Refreshed 2026-09-01 for #34 TOBIval proof and #35 Chat-to-Developer dispatch.
flowchart TD
  ChatIn[Chat or Agent turn] --> Gateway[Runtime gateway]
  Surfaces[Projects, Office, CLI, Telegram, schedulers] --> AdapterIn[Surface adapter, fail-open]
  Coding[Developer sessions] --> AdapterIn

  Gateway --> Identity[Request identity check]
  Identity --> Reuse[Same request reuses one run]
  Identity --> Run[Canonical run]
  AdapterIn --> Run

  subgraph Durable["Durable execution"]
    Run --> Plan[Validated step plan]
    Plan --> Lease[Exclusive step lease]
    Lease --> Work[Step execution]
    Work --> Checkpoint[Restart checkpoint]
    Checkpoint --> Resume[Crash resumes the same run]
    Work --> Retry[Bounded retries and cancellation]
  end

  subgraph Selection["Deterministic selection - #34"]
    Run --> Workflows[Frozen workflow catalog]
    Workflows --> Typed[Typed argument resolution]
    Typed --> Missing[A missing field asks one question]
    Typed --> Grounded[Grounded outcome with no model]
  end

  subgraph Authority["One place decides"]
    Work --> Policy[Permissions and risk tiers]
    Policy --> Approval[Owner approval when required]
    Policy --> Budget[Budget and limits]
    Policy --> Creds[Credential availability]
  end

  Approval --> Catalog[Tool catalog]
  Budget --> Catalog
  Creds --> Catalog
  Grounded --> Catalog
  Catalog --> Validate[Arguments validated before running]
  Validate --> Reserve[Action reservation]
  Reserve --> Execute[Files, terminal, projects, connectors]
  Execute --> Receipt[Immutable receipt, applied once]

  Run --> Events[Append-only ordered history]
  Events --> Redact[Secrets masked before storage]
  Redact --> Store[(SQLite canonical tables)]
  Receipt --> Store
  Checkpoint --> Store

  Events --> Projection[Current-state projection]
  Projection --> RunsView[Runs view, bounded summaries]
  RunsView --> RunsPage[Runs page]

  Run --> Traces[One trace per request]

  subgraph Evidence["TOBIval - proof before activation"]
    Traces --> Cases[Hash-locked case dataset]
    Workflows --> Cases
    Cases --> Runner[Canonical eval runner]
    Runner --> Scorers[Executable scorers and metrics]
    Scorers --> Lane[Live model lane and holdouts]
    Lane --> Gate[Release gate, owner accepted]
  end

  Gate --> Rollout[Staged activation]
  Gate --> EvalPage[Evaluations page]
  Rollout --> Compare[Seven matching comparisons required]
  Rollout --> Rollback[One switch returns new work to shadow]

  Gateway --> Shadow[Shadow mode - old path still answers]
  Shadow --> Legacy[Conductor facade and legacy tools]
  Legacy --> Compare

  Coding --> Dispatch[Chat to Developer dispatch, #35]
  Dispatch --> Confirm[Owner confirms before any work]
  Confirm --> Run
  Run --> AgentTier[Agent tier evidence registry]

  RunsPage --> Health[Health infrastructure test]
  Store --> Health
